    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p data-start="203" data-end="540"><a href="/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">Milk thistle</a>, known scientifically as <em data-start="241" data-end="259">Silybum marianum</em>, is a time-tested herbal remedy praised for its liver-protective effects. But like any natural product, it doesn&#8217;t last forever. <strong data-start="389" data-end="418">Does milk thistle expire?</strong> <strong data-start="419" data-end="458">Do milk thistle supplements go bad?</strong> These are questions we get often from bulk buyers and health-conscious consumers.</p><p data-start="542" data-end="585">In this comprehensive guide, we&#8217;ll explore:</p><ol data-start="587" data-end="956"><li data-start="587" data-end="611"><p data-start="590" data-end="611">What is milk thistle?</p></li><li data-start="612" data-end="649"><p data-start="615" data-end="649">What part of milk thistle is used?</p></li><li data-start="650" data-end="711"><p data-start="653" data-end="711">Nutritional analysis and comparison of active components</p></li><li data-start="712" data-end="756"><p data-start="715" data-end="756">What happens when milk thistle goes bad</p></li><li data-start="757" data-end="816"><p data-start="760" data-end="816">Proper storage &amp; ideal product forms for long-term use</p></li><li data-start="817" data-end="911"><p data-start="820" data-end="911">Some FAQs like: <em data-start="839" data-end="909">Do milk thistle supplements go bad? How long does milk thistle last?</em></p></li><li data-start="912" data-end="956"><p data-start="915" data-end="956">Data-backed conclusions for bulk buyers</p></li></ol><hr data-start="958" data-end="961" /><h2 data-start="963" data-end="990"></h2><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">Table of Contents</p>
